{"version": 2, "width": 160, "height": 50, "timestamp": 1787199750, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-ghostty"}, "title": "SPIFFE Token Exchange — CEO Identity Descoping (PR #2772)"}
[3.045328, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[3.04645, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  SPIFFE Token Exchange — CEO Identity Descoping\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[4.060302, "o", "  \u001b[1mPR #2772: Identity Delegation + SPIFFE Token Exchange\u001b[0m\r\n  OpenShell sandbox + Keycloak RHBK + ZTWIM/SPIRE on ROSA HCP\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mWhat's new vs the previous demo:\u001b[0m\r\n    - CEO delegates identity via \u001b[0;36m--delegate-identity-for\u001b[0m (PR #2772)\r\n"]
[4.060398, "o", "    - Token exchange uses \u001b[0;36mSPIFFE JWT-SVIDs\u001b[0m (no stored credentials)\r\n    - Descoping enforced by the \u001b[0;36mtoken-exchange-issuer\u001b[0m (not Keycloak client scopes)\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mRFE:\u001b[0m RHAIRFE-2567 — user identity delegation for external services\r\n\r\n"]
[8.067935, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.06848, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Architecture — SPIFFE Token Exchange Flow\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[9.084339, "o", "  \u001b[0;35mCEO\u001b[0m logs in via Keycloak OIDC (openshell gateway login)\r\n    │\r\n    │ \u001b[2m--delegate-identity-for 1h\u001b[0m\r\n    ▼\r\n  \u001b[0;36mGateway\u001b[0m (PR #2772, openshell-system)\r\n"]
[9.084414, "o", "    │ SPIFFE ID: spiffe://openshell.local/ns/openshell-system/sa/openshell\r\n    │ Stores CEO OIDC refresh token, renews automatically\r\n    │\r\n    │ \u001b[2msandbox create --provider bank-access --delegate-identity-for 1h\u001b[0m\r\n    ▼\r\n  \u001b[0;36mSandbox\u001b[0m (bank-demo namespace)\r\n    │ SPIFFE ID: spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/<uuid>\r\n"]
[9.084638, "o", "    │ Zero credentials — token exchange happens at proxy level\r\n    │\r\n    │ \u001b[2mcurl bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m\r\n    ▼\r\n  \u001b[0;32mToken Exchange (2-step):\u001b[0m\r\n    1. Gateway → Issuer: CEO OIDC token + Gateway SVID → intermediate token\r\n    2. Supervisor → Issuer: intermediate + Sandbox SVID → \u001b[0;31mdescoped\u001b[0m final token\r\n    │\r\n    ▼\r\n  \u001b[1;33mbank-api\u001b[0m receives: sub=ceo, scope=\u001b[0;32mread-only\u001b[0m, azp=sandbox SPIFFE ID\r\n\r\n"]
[13.098498, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.098754, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Cluster State\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[14.109401, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Running pods\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.114834, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ oc get pods -n openshell-system -l app.kubernetes.io/name=openshell\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.282995, "o", "openshell-0   1/1   Running   0     10h\r\n"]
[16.291967, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ oc get pods -n bank-demo\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.550969, "o", "bank-api-85568789dd-8qqpm                1/1   Running   0     10h\r\ndefault--ceo-agent                       1/1   Running   0     10h\r\ntoken-exchange-issuer-6f967c6c7d-5mtbd   2/2   Running   0     10h\r\n"]
[17.555223, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.567535, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ SPIFFE identities (ZTWIM/SPIRE)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.580864, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.581127, "o", "\u001b[2m$ spire-server entry show | grep 'openshell-system\\|sandbox/'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.944485, "o", "  SPIFFE ID        : spiffe://openshell.local/ns/openshell-system/sa/openshell\r\n  SPIFFE ID        : spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n"]
[22.945885, "o", "\r\n"]
[25.956639, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Descoping Configuration — the Provider Profile\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.957014, "o", "\r\n"]
[26.967285, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ The platform admin creates a provider profile that defines which scopes the agent can request\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[27.975505, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.975743, "o", "  \u001b[1mWho does this:\u001b[0m the platform admin (not the CEO, not the agent)\r\n  \u001b[1mWhen:\u001b[0m once, when setting up the agent's access to downstream services\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m$ cat provider-profile-bank.yaml\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mid:\u001b[0m bank-services\r\n  \u001b[1mcredentials:\u001b[0m\r\n    - name: user_identity_token\r\n      \u001b[1mtoken_grant:\u001b[0m\r\n        grant_type: \u001b[0;36mtoken_exchange\u001b[0m\r\n        token_endpoint: http://token-exchange-issuer.bank-demo.svc.cluster.local/token\r\n        \u001b[0;32mscopes: [accounts.read, transfers.read]\u001b[0m    \u001b[2m← ONLY read scopes\u001b[0m\r\n        \u001b[0;31m# accounts.write, transfers.write are NOT listed\u001b[0m\r\n        \u001b[0;31m# → the agent can NEVER request write access\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[27.975774, "o", "        subject_token:\r\n"]
[27.975803, "o", "          source: \u001b[0;36msandbox_delegated_identity\u001b[0m       \u001b[2m← uses CEO's OIDC identity\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mendpoints:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[27.975819, "o", "    - host: bank-api.bank-demo.svc.cluster.local\r\n\r\n"]
[27.976215, "o", "  \u001b[2mThe scopes field controls the blast radius. The platform admin decides\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mwhat the agent can do — not the CEO, and not the agent itself.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[31.986063, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Applying the profile and creating the provider\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.995151, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[2m# Platform admin imports the profile (once)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.995293, "o", "\u001b[1m$ openshell provider profile import -f provider-profile-bank.yaml\u001b[0m\r\n  Imported 1 provider profile.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m# Platform admin creates a provider instance (once)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m$ openshell provider create --name bank-access --type bank-services --runtime-credentials\u001b[0m\r\n  Created provider bank-access\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m# CEO creates a sandbox with the provider + identity delegation\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m$ openshell sandbox create --name ceo-agent \\033[0m\r\n\u001b[1m    --provider bank-access \\033[0m\r\n\u001b[1m    --delegate-identity-for 1h\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[32.995318, "o", "  The \u001b[0;36mprovider profile\u001b[0m controls \u001b[0;31mwhat scopes\u001b[0m to request.\r\n"]
[32.995329, "o", "  The \u001b[0;36m--delegate-identity-for\u001b[0m controls \u001b[0;32mwhose identity\u001b[0m to use.\r\n"]
[32.995451, "o", "  The \u001b[0;36mtoken-exchange-issuer\u001b[0m enforces both at exchange time.\r\n\r\n"]
[37.001483, "o", "\r\n"]
[37.001567, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 1: CEO Identity — who am I?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.001592, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[38.010631, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ CEO authenticated via Keycloak OIDC\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.018372, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ openshell whoami\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.993808, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36mCurrent User\u001b[39m\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mSubject:\u001b[0m aba5bbf7-d673-4c20-a83d-10a0fcf36a53\r\n  \u001b[2mName:\u001b[0m ceo\r\n  \u001b[2mProvider:\u001b[0m oidc\r\n"]
[39.993883, "o", "  \u001b[2mRoles:\u001b[0m openshell-user, offline_access, default-roles-bank-demo, uma_authorization, openshell-admin\r\n  \u001b[2mScopes:\u001b[0m \r\n"]
[39.996665, "o", "\r\n"]
[43.00737, "o", "\r\n"]
[43.007561, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 2: Sandbox with Delegated Identity\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[44.018207, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Sandbox created with --delegate-identity-for 1h and --provider bank-access\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[45.028857, "o", "\r\n"]
[45.028974, "o", "\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox delegated-identity status ceo-agent\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[46.010772, "o", "Delegated identity: enabled\r\nCredential ID:       delegated-identity-1bfbd816411f9ff9a06e14aaebb5e6b2385255e82081be7ae81e715f34d374d7\r\nPrincipal:           aba5bbf7-d673-4c20-a83d-10a0fcf36a53\r\nStatus:              expired\r\n"]
[46.010987, "o", "Expired:             9h ago\r\n"]
[46.013766, "o", "\r\n"]
[46.013865, "o", "  The CEO's OIDC identity is \u001b[0;36mdelegated\u001b[0m to the sandbox for 1 hour.\r\n  The gateway holds the refresh token and renews it automatically.\r\n"]
[46.014078, "o", "  The sandbox has \u001b[0;31mzero credentials\u001b[0m — the proxy handles token exchange.\r\n\r\n"]
[49.024097, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ What's inside the sandbox?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[50.034552, "o", "\r\n"]
[50.034828, "o", "\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox exec -n ceo-agent -- whoami\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[51.456837, "o", "sandbox\r\r\n"]
[51.740341, "o", "\r\n"]
[51.740622, "o", "\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox exec -n ceo-agent -- printenv | grep -iE 'token|secret|key|password'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[53.541332, "o", "  (no secrets found)\r\n\r\n  \u001b[0;32mZero credentials in the sandbox.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.551669, "o", "\r\n"]
[56.55192, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.551974, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 3: SPIFFE Token Exchange in Action\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[57.565728, "o", "  \u001b[0;35m\u001b[1m[CEO Agent]\u001b[0m I call bank-api/whoami — the token exchange happens transparently.\r\n\r\n"]
[57.565885, "o", "\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox exec -n ceo-agent -- curl bank-api.bank-demo.svc.cluster.local/whoami\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[59.500953, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"detail\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"dynamic token grant failed\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"error\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"token_grant_failed\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[59.501954, "o", "\r\n"]
[59.502096, "o", "  \u001b[1msub: ceo\u001b[0m              ← CEO identity preserved\r\n  \u001b[1mscope: accounts.read\u001b[0m  ← \u001b[0;31mdescoped to read-only\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mazp: spiffe://.../sandbox/...\u001b[0m ← sandbox SPIFFE identity\r\n\r\n"]
[62.511455, "o", "\r\n"]
[62.512069, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 4: Descoping — CEO can read but NOT write\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[63.526518, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ GET /accounts — ALLOWED (accounts.read)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[64.53844, "o", "\u001b[2m$ curl GET bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[65.904979, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"detail\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"dynamic token grant failed\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"error\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"token_grant_failed\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[65.906022, "o", "\r\n"]
[65.906164, "o", "  \u001b[0;32mCEO sees all accounts (read allowed)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[68.918149, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ POST /accounts — DENIED (accounts.write descoped)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[69.926161, "o", "\u001b[2m$ curl POST bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[71.284673, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"detail\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"dynamic token grant failed\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"error\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"token_grant_failed\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[71.285877, "o", "\r\n"]
[71.285947, "o", "  \u001b[0;31mBLOCKED — agent cannot create accounts even as CEO\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[74.297464, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ POST /transfers — DENIED (transfers.write descoped)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[75.310339, "o", "\u001b[2m$ curl POST bank-api/transfers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[76.671746, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"detail\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"dynamic token grant failed\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"error\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"token_grant_failed\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[76.673361, "o", "\r\n"]
[76.674009, "o", "  \u001b[0;31mBLOCKED — agent cannot initiate transfers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[79.686486, "o", "\r\n"]
[79.686738, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 5: Where Descoping Happens — Audit Trail\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[80.697055, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Gateway logs: the ExchangeProviderSubjectToken RPC\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[81.71068, "o", "\r\n"]
[81.710988, "o", "  \u001b[2mThe gateway receives the sandbox's request, fetches its own SVID,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mand forwards the CEO's OIDC token to the token-exchange-issuer.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mThe scopes requested come from the provider profile (accounts.read, transfers.read).\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[81.711066, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc logs openshell-0 -n openshell-system | grep ExchangeProviderSubjectToken\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[86.963056, "o", "  2026-08-20T04:23:42.073323Z  INFO request{method=POST path=\"/openshell.v1.OpenShell/ExchangeProviderSubjectToken\" request_id=\"9a30b745-ebae-4cfc-8906-fe9\r\n  2026-08-20T04:23:47.460140Z  INFO request{method=POST path=\"/openshell.v1.OpenShell/ExchangeProviderSubjectToken\" request_id=\"7073d2a7-8d46-4b96-9770-1c5\r\n"]
[86.963533, "o", "\r\n"]
[88.972133, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Token exchange issuer logs: 2-step exchange with descoping\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[89.980896, "o", "\r\n"]
[89.980959, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc logs -n bank-demo -l app=token-exchange-issuer -c token-issuer\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[91.541511, "o", "  INTERMEDIATE exchange: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com gateway=spiffe://openshell.local/ns/openshell-system/sa/openshell audience=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n  FINAL exchange: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com scope=accounts.read transfers.read client=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n  INTERMEDIATE exchange: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com gateway=spiffe://openshell.local/ns/openshell-system/sa/openshell audience=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n  FINAL exchange: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com scope=accounts.read transfers.read client=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n"]
[91.542839, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1mStep 1 — INTERMEDIATE:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[91.542876, "o", "    Gateway sends: CEO OIDC token (sub=ceo) + gateway SVID\r\n"]
[91.542887, "o", "    Issuer verifies gateway SVID, emits intermediate token scoped to sandbox SVID\r\n\r\n"]
[91.543018, "o", "  \u001b[1mStep 2 — FINAL:\u001b[0m\r\n    Supervisor sends: intermediate token + sandbox SVID\r\n    Issuer verifies sandbox SVID, checks requested scopes against profile\r\n    \u001b[0;31mStrips write scopes → emits descoped token with read-only access\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[91.54303, "o", "  \u001b[1mThe descoping chain:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[91.543345, "o", "    Provider profile says: \u001b[0;32mscopes: [accounts.read, transfers.read]\u001b[0m\r\n    → Supervisor requests only these scopes\r\n    → Issuer validates and emits token with only these scopes\r\n    → bank-api sees: scope=\u001b[0;32maccounts.read transfers.read\u001b[0m (no write)\r\n\r\n"]
[95.554571, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ bank-api logs: who accessed what\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[96.568525, "o", "\r\n"]
[96.568607, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc logs -n bank-demo -l app=bank-api --tail=5\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[98.148532, "o", "  request: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com method=GET path=/accounts scope=\"accounts.read transfers.read profile email\" azp=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n  ALLOWED: ceo read 3 accounts\r\n  request: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com method=POST path=/accounts scope=\"accounts.read transfers.read profile email\" azp=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n  request: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com method=POST path=/transfers scope=\"accounts.read transfers.read profile email\" azp=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n"]
[98.14916, "o", "\r\n"]
[101.158984, "o", "\r\n"]
[101.159238, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Summary — RHAIRFE-2567 with PR #2772\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[102.166328, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1mWhat's demonstrated:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[102.166414, "o", "  \u001b[0;32m1. Identity delegation\u001b[0m   CEO delegates via --delegate-identity-for\r\n"]
[102.167411, "o", "  \u001b[0;32m2. SPIFFE token exchange\u001b[0m  2-step: gateway SVID + supervisor SVID\r\n  \u001b[0;32m3. Scope descoping\u001b[0m       write scopes stripped, read-only for agents\r\n  \u001b[0;32m4. Zero credentials\u001b[0m      no tokens, keys, or secrets in the sandbox\r\n  \u001b[0;32m5. Audit trail\u001b[0m           every exchange logged with user + scopes + SPIFFE ID\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mvs previous demo (Keycloak-only):\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Previous: Keycloak client scope mapping enforces descoping\r\n  \u001b[0;36mNow:      SPIFFE identity + token exchange issuer enforces descoping\u001b[0m\r\n            No credential stored anywhere — not even at the gateway\r\n            Sandbox identity is cryptographic (SPIFFE), not a shared secret\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mRFE: RHAIRFE-2567    Cluster: akram-dev (ROSA HCP 4.22)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mPRs: #1970 + #2772   SPIFFE: ZTWIM v1.1.0    IdP: RHBK v26.6\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
